      "decode": "temperature absent samples at the server's default of 1 (HALOGEN_TEMPERATURE); temperature 0 is greedy: a forward pass and an argmax, byte-identical to serial greedy decode. temperature > 0 samples from the filtered target on the same drafter the request would otherwise get; with the MTP drafter the speculative accept/reject rule emits exactly the target distribution",
